# 【火力特赦校验 + 动态修正决策逻辑】Firepower Exemption & Override Model Convergence
# 集成位置：TopologyGameTheoryFilter 打标之后、MoE门控之前 (apply_firepower_exemption)
#          UnifiedConvergenceArbitrator 仲裁之后 (override_model_convergence)
